OL,3,GNEWSACall to save 'unloved' leisure
OL,4,Acentre from closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign has been launched in a bid
OL,7,Fto save the New Parks Leisure Centre in
OL,8,FLeicester from closure.
OL,10,FLeicester City Council said the
OL,11,F51-year-old complex in St Oswald's Road
OL,12,Fwas the least used of the seven leisure
OL,13,Fcentres it runs, required #2.8m of
OL,14,Frepairs over the next few years, and
OL,15,Fwas no longer financially viable.
OL,17,FHowever, the Leicester Penguins
OL,18,FSwimming Club, which uses the site's
OL,19,Fpool, said the proposed closure came
OL,20,F"out of the blue" when it was announced
OL,21,Fthis week.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
